--- Opens a new UPluralRules object using the predefined cardinal-number plural rules for a
--- given locale.
--- Same as uplrules_openForType(locale, UPLURAL_TYPE_CARDINAL, status).
--- locale: The locale for which the rules are desired.
--- status: A pointer to a UErrorCode to receive any errors.
--- Returns: A UPluralRules for the specified locale, or NULL if an error occurred.
--- @stable ICU 4.8
